WEIERSTRASS ELLIPTIC AND RELATED FUNCTIONS (p.634)
Two sub-columns below, \Delta>0 (left) and \Delta<0 (right):
18.3.21  [\Delta>0] \sigma(\omega/2)=\dfrac{e^{\eta\omega/8}}{2^{1/4}H_1^{3/8}(2H_1+3e_1)^{1/8}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(\omega_2/2)=\dfrac{e^{\eta_2\omega_2/8}}{2^{1/4}H_2^{3/8}(2H_2+3e_2)^{1/8}}
18.3.22  [\Delta>0] \wp(\omega'/2)=e_3-H_3<e_3<0   |   [\Delta<0] \wp(\omega_2'/2)=e_2-H_2=\wp(\omega_2+\omega_2'/2)<e_2<0
18.3.23  [\Delta>0] \wp'(\omega'/2)=-2H_3i\sqrt{2H_3-3e_3}   |   [\Delta<0] \wp'(\omega_2'/2)=-2H_2i\sqrt{2H_2-3e_2}=\overline{\wp'}(\omega_2+\omega_2'/2)
18.3.24  [\Delta>0] \zeta(\omega'/2)=\frac12[\eta'-i\sqrt{2H_3-3e_3}]   |   [\Delta<0] \zeta(\omega_2'/2)=\frac12[\eta_2'-i\sqrt{2H_2-3e_2}]=-\zeta(\omega_2+\omega_2'/2)+2\eta'
18.3.25  [\Delta>0] \sigma(\omega'/2)=\dfrac{ie^{\eta'\omega'/8}}{2^{1/4}H_3^{3/8}(2H_3-3e_3)^{1/8}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(\omega_2'/2)=\dfrac{ie^{\eta_2'\omega_2'/8}}{2^{1/4}H_2^{3/8}(2H_2-3e_2)^{1/8}}=\sigma(\omega_2+\omega_2'/2)\exp[-\eta'\omega_2]   (continuation clause printed only on the \Delta<0 side)
18.3.26  [\Delta>0] \wp(\omega_2/2)=e_2-H_2   |   [\Delta<0] \wp(\omega'/2)=e_3-H_3
18.3.27  [\Delta>0] \wp'(\omega_2/2)=-2H_2i(2H_2-3e_2)^{1/2}   |   [\Delta<0] \wp'(\omega'/2)=-2iH_3(2H_3-3e_3)^{1/2}
18.3.28  [\Delta>0] \zeta(\omega_2/2)=\frac12[\eta_2-i(2H_2-3e_2)^{1/2}]   |   [\Delta<0] \zeta(\omega'/2)=\frac12[\eta'-i(2H_3-3e_3)^{1/2}]
18.3.29  [\Delta>0] \sigma(\omega_2/2)=\dfrac{e^{\eta_2\omega_2/8}e^{i\pi/4}}{[4H_2^3(2H_2-3e_2)]^{1/8}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(\omega'/2)=\dfrac{e^{\eta'\omega'/8}e^{i\pi/4}}{[4H_3^3(2H_3-3e_3)]^{1/8}}
One-Third Period Relations
At z=2\omega_i/3 (i=1,2,3) or 2\omega_2'/3, \wp''^2=12\wp\wp'^2; equivalently:
18.3.30  48\wp^4-24g_2\wp^2-48g_3\wp-g_2^2=0   (single statement, spans both sub-columns)
Two sub-columns again below, \Delta>0 (left) and \Delta<0 (right):
18.3.31  [\Delta>0] \zeta(2\omega/3)=\dfrac{2\eta}{3}+\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}   |   [\Delta<0] \zeta(2\omega_2/3)=\dfrac{2\eta_2}{3}+\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega_2/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}
18.3.32  [\Delta>0] \zeta(2\omega'/3)=\dfrac{2\eta'}{3}-\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega'/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}   |   [\Delta<0] \zeta(2\omega_2'/3)=\dfrac{2\eta_2'}{3}-\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega_2'/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}
18.3.33  [\Delta>0] \zeta(2\omega_2/3)=\dfrac{2\eta_2}{3}+\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega_2/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}   |   [\Delta<0] \zeta(2\omega'/3)=\dfrac{2\eta'}{3}+\left[\dfrac{\wp(2\omega'/3)}{3}\right]^{1/2}
18.3.34  [\Delta>0] \sigma(2\omega/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta\omega/9]}{\sqrt[3]{\wp'(2\omega/3)}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(2\omega_2/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta_2\omega_2/9]}{\sqrt[3]{\wp'(2\omega_2/3)}}
18.3.35  [\Delta>0] \sigma(2\omega'/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta'\omega'/9]}{[\wp'(2\omega'/3)]^{1/3}e^{2\pi i/3}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(2\omega_2'/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta_2'\omega_2'/9]}{[\wp'(2\omega_2'/3)]^{1/3}e^{2\pi i/3}}
18.3.36  [\Delta>0] \sigma(2\omega_2/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta_2\omega_2/9]}{[\wp'(2\omega_2/3)]^{1/3}e^{2\pi i/3}}   |   [\Delta<0] \sigma(2\omega'/3)=\dfrac{-\exp[2\eta'\omega'/9]}{[\wp'(2\omega'/3)]^{1/3}e^{2\pi i/3}}
Legendre's Relation
18.3.37  [\Delta>0] \eta\omega'-\eta'\omega=\pi i/2   |   [\Delta<0] \eta_2\omega_2'-\eta_2'\omega_2=\pi i
(also valid for \Delta<0)
Relations Among the H_i
18.3.38  H_1^2+H_2^2+H_3^2=3g_2/4   (single statement, spans both sub-columns)
18.3.39  H_1^2H_2^2+H_2^2H_3^2+H_3^2H_1^2=0   (single statement, spans both sub-columns)
